stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CLOSED
    CLOSED --> OPEN: 5 retryable failures in 30 s\n(or 5 consecutive)
    OPEN --> HALF_OPEN: cooldown elapsed\n(30 s, doubles on repeated failure, cap 5 min)
    HALF_OPEN --> CLOSED: 2 consecutive probe successes
    HALF_OPEN --> OPEN: probe fails\n(cooldown doubles, capped)
    OPEN --> OPEN: calls fail fast\n503 circuit_open + Retry-After
    CLOSED --> CLOSED: 4xx config/validation\n(does not count)
    note right of OPEN
        One breaker per dependency:
        embedding / chat / database.
        Only retryable errors count.
    end note
